    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$drift_intro",
        "key": "$drift_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've decided.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sounds like you aren't asking, Dr. Kal'tsit... Sorry, I just realized, I'm supposed to call you Lord Kal'tsit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no point in talking about that now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just want to express my disappointment at your decision. You could have been a great help to Theresa.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Her Majesty... came to me alone, after the last mission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sounds like her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She said she remembered me, where I came from, in Kazdel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "The huge industrial district, and the endless rotten, crime-ridden city of death that stretches out around it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "The influx of refugees growing the slums up skyward.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "How many 'nobles' do you think there are in Kazdel? How many of them are Sarkaz who gave themselves some stupid title in an even stupider war?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "As many as there are weeds in a garden.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's a good one. They are like weeds.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "But Her Majesty might remember.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "I appreciate her kindness. She remembers the last bit of humanity left in the Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's the only one who could.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So why are you trying to escape?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052"
    },
    {
        "text": "Put it a little rougher, why don't you, Doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ines, Dr. Kal'tsit has done a lot for us. You know that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049"
    },
    {
        "text": "No offense intended.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you've decided to leave, I have no right to stop you. You can go and be free, travel the world as mercenaries.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't need me to tell you that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But what about the other Sarkaz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "W has her own plans.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "And it's not like we have the power to make every mercenary follow the rules.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's how mercenaries are. It's a lot harder to keep order with these free spirits than with big standing armies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "But some lost Sarkaz warriors could stand to learn from you... that which you seek.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Regardless, you've chosen your path.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if it's a dead end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Us mercenaries only know how to dive into war, to hide ourselves in the smoke from its wake of ruin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I hope that works out for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_coldforest",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052"
    },
    {
        "text": "...There are barely any Sarkaz still following us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A lot of them decided to stay, but there's even more who don't get to pick where home is anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The camp's gone. The only equipment left is the bottom of the barrel stuff Babel left us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're more like campers going mountain climbing than mercenaries at this point...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...It's always been like that, all the way back to when we first met in that birch grove and decided to carve our own path.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good thing Dr. Kal'tsit gave us a few special contracts. At least we'll be able to get by.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If we're still going to be running errands for her, what difference does it make whether we leave Babel or not?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We're just a team of mercenaries fighting to make a profit, taking a lucrative contract.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're lying to yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Wait, where's our flag?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I kept it. And everything else. If I'm gonna lie to myself, might as well be thorough about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "You remember right? Back then, whenever a standard-bearer fell, another would always step up right away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "From the west to the east, becoming a mercenary, then all the way back here. That whole time, this flag never fell.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Up until the 70th, or maybe 80th standard-bearer died. He impaled his own abdomen with the flagpole to keep it up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "When we were escorting the Rhodes Island landship, those enemies... those monsters from Kazdel, shredded our lines like paper.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "When that happened, it was just a kid holding the flag.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "The enemy had the high ground. Arts rained down around us like a mudslide.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before Dr. Kal'tsit arrived, there was pretty much nothing we could do to fight back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The flags are all in tatters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I've still got hands. I can hold up a flagpole.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I never liked flying a merc flag.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "It should've been stomped into the mud a long time ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How many vets from the old days are still alive?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You, and me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Let's not waste any more time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_battlefield",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Hoederer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you leave W with Her Majesty on purpose?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you think about Her Majesty? And Kal'tsit? And especially... that 'Doctor?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Never took you for the gossipy type.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Just making small talk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "You didn't use your Arts once the whole time you were there. That's not like you. I was worried maybe\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I didn't have the guts. Not with the way Dr. Kal'tsit was looking at me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's an unknown quantity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, better not dig too deep. Just knowing who that Kal'tsit is...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But, I might've accidentally taken a peek at Her Majesty. My Arts can't look directly into peoples' minds. More like I can get a feel for them by looking over their 'shadows'...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Her Majesty is very special.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's... tragic. But extremely resilient, and gentle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit is strange. She has this almost mechanical feel to her, but like a machine, how can I put it? Full of humanity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...You're talking about Kal'tsit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't feel it, can you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "She sees us all as equals. She didn't call us 'devils.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe just because Her Majesty was there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about the one they just call 'The Doctor?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Let's put it like this: the soldiers are the pawns in the game. The commander is the player.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I saw the Doctor, I was struck with the feeling that I'm always gonna be a pawn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That one's not a battlefield commander. The Doctor runs the whole war.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not why.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know what the biggest difference is between the piece and the player?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No... But why are you talking like W now? You were always impatient. Never heard you talking in riddles like this before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A chess player's main focus is never on the pieces, or even the game. It's always on the other player. You always want to beat an even match.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "After a win, the player goes home to a nice, hot meal. The pieces get popped back into the box and stashed away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "The player gets to sleep, wake up, walk, and talk.  The pieces just sit there in the cupboard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're all objects. Inanimate objects. There was only one person, one thing really alive on that battlefield. And it was that one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we're still gonna call ourselves people, then, well... the Doctor's something else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay then. I think it's safe to say we agree on that one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But it looks like Her Majesty, Kal'tsit, and whoever else don't really mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit's always been careful. And even though we weren't working together for very long, I got the impression their troops are kind of in the dark about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "I told W: some things are already starting to change.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Leaving might be the right call.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, you still didn't answer my question. If we're on the same page, why'd you leave W there then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you worried about her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So what if I am? Answer me already.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...For insurance. Just in case one day, we have to switch sides.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or do you think the Regent, Her Majesty's brother, will open his heart, say 'all is forgiven,' and keep letting us raid the Lateranos?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to get away from this war. I'm sick of fighting our own people... and we've already suffered enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hmph.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't get me wrong, W buying us some insurance wasn't the original plan...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "But her face lit up when I told her she could stay...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch... What an ingrate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_corridor_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness02_intro",
        "key": "$darkness02_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_026",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You've taken to our work unexpectedly quickly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "text": "And that goes for your two friends as well. Though they didn't accept the Doctor's invitation to stay, they still performed their work admirably.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh-huh. So, did Theresa say anything?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_026",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...If you seek Her Majesty's praise, you may petition for an audience with her yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "text": "Assuming that you can avoid Ms. Kal'tsit, that is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_026",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "There goes that idea. That bitch is stuck to Theresa like glue. Tch, what a headache.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, where are they now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_026",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And yet you still intend to seek her out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_026",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I just want to go take a look. Can't get chewed out for doing that, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_026",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Now who's the bigger headache?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_026",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, I worked my ass off to dig out seven spies stuck in with your refugees. Seven! And a caster too! Do you know how hard that was?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_026",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Keep it down. Your presence, as well as the details of your mission are both confidential... Shh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "text": "That was your job, and if I recall correctly, the Doctor asked you to keep at least one alive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_026",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, the 'alive' part is trickier than you'd think. Guy offed himself before I could even murk him. What's a girl supposed to do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_026",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...*Sigh*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're on the bridge. Amiya should be there too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_026",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You talk like I remember all these names. As if I care.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_026",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's your business...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Just a moment, what's that in your hand?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_026",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, this? A little camera that I yoinked from one of the spies. Pretty rare, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_026",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't tell me you're going to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_026",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What? Is a Sarkaz gonna pass up an opportunity to get a selfie with Her Majesty?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_026",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Well, if Ms. Kal'tsit apprehends you as a spy, don't expect me to bail you out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_026",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure, sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "How'd those spies manage to get in here anyway?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_026",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_026",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you think... we've been going at our fights kinda weird lately?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_026",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not an area where you or I should be pointing fingers. If you're dissatisfied, take it up with the Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Doctor, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe next time then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_corridor_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Over there? Sure enough, of that's all of them. I'm gonna lie low for a sec.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "(What's with the tiny bunny? The little shit's ears are blocking Theresa!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Uh oh! Kal'tsit...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "\uff08......\uff09",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "(...She's not coming over here? Did she not see me?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Damnit, what's the Doctor doing here? Get that one in my picture and it's 100% cursed...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "\uff08......\uff09",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Aww, Theresa's laughing.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Screw it, I won't get another opportunity like this!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cheese\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "text": "...W, do you even know what's going on right now?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uhh, probably better than you do? I'm the one actually down on the battlefield putting in work, 'Dr. K'~"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's fine, Kal'tsit. There's no need to be angry\u2014"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh, what a bitch... All that over a stupid picture!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you might not like the next job so much, Mr. Captive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmmf! Nnnngh...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Captive"
    },
    {
        "text": "C'mon, don't be so nervous. You brave enough to get so close to the Speaker's Office. Surely you came prepared to have your cover blown?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I'm in a pretty bad mood, so you're not gonna have a good time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Captive"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? Trying to off yourself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't rush it. We're not ready for that. Not until I ask you some questions first. Now what was it...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "What happened at the Battle of the Mill last month?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "What reason do you have to be here? Why are you so close to the capital?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you after? Who do you answer to? What were you trying to give Theresis?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, take your time, no need to knee-jerk me an answer here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "What I really want to know is, say there's an Originium needle hovering by that eye you can't close. If I was to slowly push it in at a speed of three millimeters per second\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would you be afraid?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hoederer's prediction was correct. The war is starting to change."
    },
    {
        "text": "But to be honest, I lost interest in watching the situation in Kazdel unfold... Not like it affects me, anyway."
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just worried... about Theresa."
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though seeing that damned woman is about as revolting as seeing my reflection smiling back at me in the mirror, maybe I do have to talk to her."
    },
    {
        "text": "She and I are the same kind of person. If she can even be considered a 'person,' that is. That's one of a whole bunch of mysteries floating around her."
    },
    {
        "text": "But she's much stronger than me. Maybe she will be able to protect Theresa\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, she has to."
    },
    {
        "text": "Otherwise\u2014\u2013"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "fadetime": 1,
